  "joinIsOneToManyForSomeWorkflows": {
    "whatThisIs": "Six of the twenty registry records carry TWO candidate flows for one workflow id, and the capture did not choose between them. For those six, \"the flow behind this endpoint\" is not one thing, and any reading that picks one silently is asserting something this evidence does not say.",
